- Psychiatrist Phone: {{ $('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_psych_phone }}
- Psychiatrist Address: {{ $('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_psych_address }}
- Psych Record Date (date of the psychiatric note used to create the client in Clio): {{ $('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_full_object.tcm_social_needs?.psych_record_date }}
- Psych Clinic Name (where the psychiatrist practices, from that note): {{ $('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_full_object.tcm_social_needs?.psych_clinic_name }}
- Psych Record Type (evaluation, progress note..., from that note): {{ $('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_full_object.tcm_social_needs?.psych_record_type }}
- Psychiatrist Medications: {{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_psych_medications) }}
- Pharmacy Name: {{ $('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_pharmacy_name }}
- Pharmacy Phone: {{ $('Normalize & Prepare Context').item.json.patient_pharmacy_phone }}
